# NAME: Telegram - ASN
# DESC: Telegram autonomous systems. Matches every IP Telegram announces under
#   its own ASNs, so new Telegram IPs are covered without maintaining CIDR lists.
#   ASNs verified against BGP data (Telegram Messenger Inc):
#   AS62041 (Telegram Messenger EUR), AS62014 (APAC), AS59930 (NA),
#   AS44907 (Telegram Messenger CDN), AS211157 (Telegram Messenger Inc).
#   Reference this after all domain rulesets.
# NOTE: RULE-SET file for Surge 6 - one rule per line, without a policy. See https://manual.nssurge.com/rules/ip.html

IP-ASN,62041,no-resolve
IP-ASN,62014,no-resolve
IP-ASN,59930,no-resolve
IP-ASN,44907,no-resolve
IP-ASN,211157,no-resolve
